“onshore finance leasing” means the onshore leasing of any
machinery or plant under any finance lease;
“onshore leasing” means the leasing, other than offshore leasing,
of any machinery or plant;
“operating leasing” means the leasing of any machinery or plant,
other than finance leasing.

